# <%= subnetwork_title() %> Explorer - Full Documentation for LLMs

> Comprehensive technical context, architecture, and API guide for <%= subnetwork_title() %> Explorer.

## Network Information
- Network: <%= network_title() %>
- Subnetwork / Chain: <%= subnetwork_title() %>
- Native Coin: <%= coin() %>
- Explorer URL: <%= host() %>

## Overview
<%= subnetwork_title() %> Explorer is an open-source, EVM-compatible block explorer powered by Blockscout. It provides indexing and querying for blocks, transactions, smart contracts, tokens (ERC-20, ERC-721, ERC-1155), logs, and account balances.

## Key APIs for Developers and AI Agents

### 1. REST API v2 (Recommended)
Base URL: `<%= host() %>/api/v2`
All responses are formatted in JSON.
- `GET <%= host() %>/api/v2/blocks`: List recent blocks (supports pagination).
- `GET <%= host() %>/api/v2/blocks/{block_number_or_hash}`: Get details of a specific block.
- `GET <%= host() %>/api/v2/transactions`: List recent transactions.
- `GET <%= host() %>/api/v2/transactions/{tx_hash}`: Get transaction details, receipt, and status.
- `GET <%= host() %>/api/v2/addresses/{address_hash}`: Query address information, <%= coin() %> balance, and contract status.
- `GET <%= host() %>/api/v2/addresses/{address_hash}/transactions`: Transactions associated with an address.
- `GET <%= host() %>/api/v2/addresses/{address_hash}/token-balances`: Token holdings of an address.
- `GET <%= host() %>/api/v2/tokens`: List tracked tokens with search and filter.
- `GET <%= host() %>/api/v2/tokens/{token_address}`: Token details, total supply, decimals, and holders count.
- `GET <%= host() %>/api/v2/smart-contracts`: List verified smart contracts.
- `GET <%= host() %>/api/v2/smart-contracts/{address_hash}`: Fetch smart contract source code, ABI, and compilation metadata.
- Interactive Swagger/OpenAPI documentation: `<%= host() %>/api-docs`

### 2. Ethereum JSON-RPC Compatible API
Base URL: `<%= host() %>/api/eth-rpc` or `<%= host() %>/api`
- Standard RPC module endpoints supporting `eth_blockNumber`, `eth_getBlockByNumber`, `eth_getTransactionByHash`, `eth_call`, etc.
- Interactive Eth RPC documentation: `<%= host() %>/eth-rpc-api-docs`

### 3. GraphQL API
Base URL: `<%= host() %>/graphql`
- Full GraphQL API for flexible querying across blocks, transactions, and addresses.
- GraphiQL explorer: `<%= host() %>/graphiql`
- GraphQL Schema: `<%= host() %>/schema.graphql`

## Smart Contract Interaction
- Verified contracts expose their ABI and source code at `<%= host() %>/address/{address_hash}?tab=contract`.
- Read and Write contract tabs allow direct interaction with deployed contracts through web3 or JSON-RPC.

## Common Data Types
- Address: 42-character hexadecimal string starting with `0x`.
- Transaction Hash: 66-character hexadecimal string starting with `0x`.
- Block Number: Positive integer.
- Token Values: Standard ERC-20 token values are returned in their smallest unit (base units) according to their decimals.

## Discovery Files
- [llms.txt](<%= host() %>/llms.txt): Concise index for AI/LLMs.
- [sitemap.xml](<%= host() %>/sitemap.xml): Search engine indexing map.
- [robots.txt](<%= host() %>/robots.txt): Web crawler rules.
- [ads.txt](<%= host() %>/ads.txt): Authorized digital sellers.
